+archive = await snapshotInstalledPackage(dest, packageName, audit.version)
+registerProfileDependency(profileDir, packageName, audit.version, `file:${archive.archive}`)
+syncProfileLockfile(profileDir, packageName, `file:${archive.archive}`, audit.version, archive.integrity)
+```
